Root Bridge Election & Port Roles
•	Bridge ID (BID): Formed by Priority (default 32768) + System ID Extension (VLAN ID) + Switch MAC Address.

•	Determinism: Alex explicitly forced the Primary Core Switch to become the Root Bridge for VLAN 10 using spanning-tree vlan 10 root primary (setting priority to 24576).

•	Convergence: Rapid PVST+ achieves sub-3-second convergence using direct Proposal/Agreement handshakes across three states (Discarding, Learning, and Forwarding).

